{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53380","headline":"赠顾况诗 · 苏州刺史","name":"赠顾况诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟强东晋日，竹树有名园。\n年代更多主，池塘复裔孙。\n（见宋朱长文《吴郡图经续纪》卷下）（〖1〗《吴郡图经续记》：「辟强园，唐时犹在。\n顾况尝假以居。\n郡守赠诗曰〖略〗。\n」郡守姓名不详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏州刺史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}